00:12:05.090 --> 00:12:07.190
and it kills all the viruses in your nose.

00:12:10.440 --> 00:12:14.740
- This is the prime
example of misinformation,

00:12:14.740 --> 00:12:17.150
where it sounds like
something's totally feasible

00:12:17.150 --> 00:12:19.060
and reasonable to do to protect yourself

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:20.370
