00:12:20.370 --> 00:12:22.350
that has zero scientific backing,

00:12:22.350 --> 00:12:25.340
and it has 100% potential to harm you.

00:12:25.340 --> 00:12:26.950
So if you're gonna have a blow dryer,

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:29.160
first of all, most blow
dryers, I just looked this up,

